# Design Spec: Atlas Core Dashboard Density Refactoring
**Author:** Zed Cross  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D13 10:50  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Refactored the Atlas Core dashboard design system and component layout to drastically cut visual noise, consolidating 14 arbitrary spacing values into a strict 8pt grid token system and aligning metric hierarchies with Company Document specifications.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "spec_version": "2.4.0",
  "project": "Atlas Core",
  "author": "Zed Cross (Design / o3)",
  "objective": "Simplify dashboard density and eliminate layout token debt",
  "governance_reference": {
    "document": "Company Document",
    "usage": "Applied visual hierarchy rules from Company Document (Sec. 3: Hybrid SaaS & F2F Operational Surfaces) to establish primary vs secondary KPI weighting, ensuring field-agent statuses remain legible while shedding 40% of non-essential card chrome."
  },
  "refactoring_audit": {
    "pruned_elements": [
      "Redundant card header sub-dividers (border-b-neutral-200)",
      "Duplicate F2F service badge indicators on row items",
      "6 legacy non-standard spacing tokens (px-3.5, gap-7, py-5)"
    ],
    "consolidated_tokens": {
      "density_mode": "compact_unified",
      "spacing_scale": {
        "space_inset_card": "16px",
        "space_grid_gap": "12px",
        "space_inline_item": "8px"
      },
      "typography": {
        "metric_display": "text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-6",
        "metric_label": "text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider",
        "meta_caption": "text-2xs font-normal text-slate-400"
      }
    }
  },
  "layout_architecture": {
    "grid": "grid-cols-12 gap-3 max-w-7xl mx-auto",
    "widget_slots": [
      {"slot": "kpi_strip", "span": "col-span-12", "height": "84px", "density": "condensed"},
      {"slot": "realtime_f2f_pipeline", "span": "col-span-8", "height": "380px", "density": "standard"},
      {"slot": "saas_telemetry", "span": "col-span-4", "height": "380px", "density": "standard"}
    ]
  }
}
```